# browser AES-256-GCM implementation. Forwards to the linked cipher runtime shim (browser Web Crypto SubtleCrypto). Internal: reached only through the public cipher API.

dock load
  load <global:cipher>, name cipher

task encrypt-aes-gcm
  note async
  take key, like text
  take nonce, like text
  take plain, like text
  like text
  send back
    call cipher/encrypt
      read key
      read nonce
      read plain

task decrypt-aes-gcm
  note async
  take key, like text
  take nonce, like text
  take sealed, like text
  like text
  send back
    call cipher/decrypt
      read key
      read nonce
      read sealed
